        "bridgeIn": "Picture a quiet conservation lab in Cleveland, Ohio, three days before a museum's biggest winter gala, where a single brushstroke threatened to upend a one-point-four-million-dollar quarterly forecast.",
        "bridgeOut": "Every row in that spreadsheet represents a person who walked through the door expecting the truth. Let's look at what these numbers actually mean for the people trusting us today.",
