        "pacingAndEnergy": "Start unhurried and rhythmic, like a slow walking bassline. Accelerate slightly during the rehearsal friction in Act II, drop into a heavy, late-night stillness in Act III, and let Act IV unfold beat-by-beat before landing Act V with quiet warmth.",
