      "craftBreakdown": {
        "setupSummary": "Establishes a tactile, rain-soaked command trailer where an automated probability dashboard dictates search resources, contrasting sterile metrics with a veteran tracker's field intuition.",
        "turnOrMisdirection": "When the high-probability sector returns ninety-eight percent searched with zero results, the tracker bypasses the model's assumptions and reads a three-millimeter snapped alder twig that the digital map could never register.",
        "payoffOrTag": "Pause for two full seconds after switching off the monitor, then click to your data slide and ask the audience which three-millimeter signals their current dashboard is ignoring.",
        "whyItLands": "It validates the usefulness of data models without demonizing them, while proving that human judgment and granular observation are what rescue the edge cases."
      },
