        "audienceVibe": "Analytical, skeptical of fluff, tired of spreadsheets, and secretly relieved when someone validates the messy reality behind their numbers.",
        "bridgeIn": "Before looking at the next slide of quarterly variance numbers, think about what happened in the Belgian city of Bruges one November morning, when a single red cell on a municipal spreadsheet nearly broke four hundred-year-old church bells.",
        "bridgeOut": "That is what happens when we measure a living system with a dead ruler. Looking at our Q3 numbers on this next slide, the question isn't why the cells are red\u2014it's what the echo is trying to tell us.",
