        "bridgeIn": "Before looking at the Q3 variance column on this next slide, picture a rain-slicked brick warehouse on Depot Street in Asheville, North Carolina, where a ceramicist named Clara Vance was staring at forty-eight ruined bowls.",
        "bridgeOut": "That red number on the spreadsheet isn't always a failure\u2014sometimes it's the only honest signal telling you where the real value is trying to break through.",
