        "audienceVibe": "Analytical, skeptical, or fatigued by dense performance dashboards and variance tables.",
        "bridgeIn": "Before looking at the red variance on this next slide, picture a Tuesday afternoon in late August, high on a granite ridge in western Montana, where a single cell on a regional dashboard was about to collide with twenty lives.",
        "bridgeOut": "That red cell on the screen looks like a failure if you only read the column. When you know what happened on the ridge, you realize it is the price of bringing everyone home.",
        "avoidWhen": "Avoid when the audience is expecting a purely lighthearted icebreaker or when the metric being discussed is a minor administrative delay with no real stakes."
