        "bridgeIn": "Consider what unfolded in a municipal engineering office in Pittsburgh one November morning in 1994, when a single column on a budget printout nearly cost a neighborhood its bridge.",
        "bridgeOut": "Every number on this next slide is accurate, but none of them can tap the steel. As we look at these metrics together, ask what lives underneath the green.",
