        "bridgeIn": "Before anyone stares at the recovery curve on the next slide, consider what happened to a veteran jazz trumpeter named Rayford Vance in a damp basement club in Kansas City one November.",
        "bridgeOut": "When a metric drops and then crawls back, the spreadsheet only draws a line. Underneath that line, someone is learning how to hold the horn against a different shape.",
